HandleFragmentPositionJump: write an AVLOG_USER_AAMP_JUMP record (track, delta,
lastInjectedDuration, absPosition in microseconds) for any non-zero delta and
ask avlog.ko for a capture window when |delta| >= 1 ms.
Both IsoBmffHelper::RestampPts call sites (whole fragments in
ProcessAndInjectFragment, LL-DASH chunks in ProcessFragmentChunk): write an
AVLOG_USER_AAMP_RESTAMP record whenever the PTS offset applied to a track
changes (old and new offset, first fragment position, timescale, discontinuity
index); a change while playing also asks for a capture window.
A failed write is reported once on stderr. No-op when avlog.ko is not loaded.
